I've often managed to get to the final zoo without monsters becoming
awake. I'm quite certain the boulders won't wake things.

Monsters in a zoo will always wake up if you're not stealthy or(and)
if you make noise, like kicking down the door, make a 'noisy' creature
angry (e.g. cats, dogs, nagas), having a monster explode, kicking a
food ration into a trapdoor ...

Monsters typically generated in groups also tend to start out awake in
treasure zoos - orc gangs are quite frequent in the sokoban zoo.

